WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:26.447
Bird found a lot of worms.

2
00:00:26.448 --> 00:00:29.828
Soon she was ready to meet Kip.

3
00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:36.410
Bird flew to the beach.

4
00:00:36.411 --> 00:00:41.295
She looked all over.

5
00:00:41.296 --> 00:00:44.170
But Bird didn't see Kip anywhere.

6
00:00:44.171 --> 00:00:48.109
"Where is Kip?" said Bird.

7
00:00:48.110 --> 00:00:56.634
Bird flew back to the park.

8
00:00:56.635 --> 00:00:58.733
And then she saw Kip!

9
00:00:58.734 --> 00:01:03.007
Kip was doing push-ups.

10
00:01:03.008 --> 00:01:05.180
"Kip!" said Bird.

11
00:01:05.181 --> 00:01:07.848
"Why aren't you at the beach?"

12
00:01:07.849 --> 00:01:09.621
Kip stood up.

13
00:01:09.622 --> 00:01:12.816
"I'm training," he said.

14
00:01:12.817 --> 00:01:15.665
He did jumping jacks.

15
00:01:15.666 --> 00:01:20.244
"What are you training for?" asked Bird.

16
00:01:20.245 --> 00:01:24.109
"There's a big race tomorrow," said Kip.

17
00:01:24.110 --> 00:01:27.805
"I'm going to win!"

18
00:01:27.806 --> 00:01:30.803
Kip sat down and stretched.

19
00:01:30.804 --> 00:01:34.064
He tried to touch his toes.

20
00:01:34.065 --> 00:01:36.316
Then he got up and ran.

21
00:01:36.317 --> 00:01:43.512
Kip ran to the playground.

22
00:01:43.513 --> 00:01:46.594
"You're very fast," said Bird.

23
00:01:46.595 --> 00:01:57.731
"Yes, I am," called Kip.

24
00:01:57.732 --> 00:02:01.079
Kip ran back to Bird.

25
00:02:01.080 --> 00:02:05.262
He panted hard.

26
00:02:05.263 --> 00:02:12.475
"I'm going . . . to win . . . the big race!"
